# Repo-local scrub denylist for .githooks/scrub-staged.sh.
# Copy to scrub-denylist.txt (gitignored) and add patterns one per line.
# Each line is a PCRE regex; prefix `(?i)` for case-insensitive matching.
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Examples (uncomment and edit for your org):
#
# Internal hosts
# (?i)<your-company>\.atlassian\.net
# (?i)<your-company>\.slack\.com
# (?i)<your-company>\.lattice\.com
#
# Internal project / repo names not covered by $GITHUB_ORG
# (?i)\b<internal-monorepo-name>\b
# (?i)\b<internal-service-name>\b
#
# Slack thread / DM URL fragments
# https://app\.slack\.com/client/T[A-Z0-9]+/[A-Z0-9]+
#
# Confluence / Notion internal pages
# (?i)<your-company>\.atlassian\.net/wiki/spaces/
